flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Collect[Collect Inputs\nCLI args → Stdin → Clipboard]
    Collect --> Categorize{Categorize by Extension}

    Categorize -->|*.txt / raw text| TextPath[Text/Prompt Path]
    Categorize -->|*.png, *.jpg, etc.| ImgPath[Image Path]
    Categorize -->|*.safetensors| LoraPath[LoRA Path]
    Categorize -->|*.json| WfPath[Workflow Path]

    %% Text Logic
    TextPath --> TCount{Count?}
    TCount -->|1| TSingle[Use as-is]
    TCount -->|>1| TMode{MULTIPLE_INPUT setting}
    TMode -->|"combine" / 1| TCombine[Join with \n\n → Single Prompt]
    TMode -->|"multi" / 2 | TMulti[One prompt per job]

    %% Image Logic
    ImgPath --> ICount{Count?}
    ICount -->|0| INone[txt2img: EmptyLatentImage]
    ICount -->|1| ISingle[i2i: Wire to LoadImage node]
    ICount -->|>1| IMode{MULTIPLE_INPUT setting}
    IMode -->|"combine" / 1| ICombineCheck{Workflow has >1\nLoadImage nodes?}
    ICombineCheck -->|Yes| IAssign[Map images to each node]
    ICombineCheck -->|No| IPack[Pack into single grid image]
    IMode -->|"multi" / 2 | IMulti[One image per job]

    %% LoRA Logic
    LoraPath --> LCount{Count?}
    LCount -->|0| LNone[Use original/none]
    LCount -->|1| LSingle[Inject before existing loader]
    LCount -->|>1| LMode{MULTIPLE_SAFETENSORS setting}
    LMode -->|"combine" / 1| LChain[Chain all in single job]
    LMode -->|"multi" / 2 | LMulti[One LoRA per job]

    %% Workflow Logic
    WfPath --> WLoad["Load each .json independently\n(Always runs ALL)"]

    %% Job Planning & Output
    TSingle & TCombine & TMulti & INone & ISingle & IAssign & IPack & IMulti & LNone & LSingle & LChain & LMulti & WLoad --> Plan[Job Planner]
    Plan --> Matrix{Build Job Matrix}
    Matrix -->|Images ≤ 1 assignment| Cartesian["Cartesian Product:\nPrompts × LoRA Groups × Image Assignment"]
    Matrix -->|Images > 1 assignment| Cycle["Cycle Pairs:\nPrompt[i] + Image[i] × LoRA Groups"]

    Cartesian & Cycle --> Queue[Queue to ComfyUI Server]
    Queue --> Wait[Wait via WebSocket & download]
    Wait --> Output(["Output: 1 generated image per job\nsaved to output_dir"])
